守欲距不為發兵，助乃斬一司馬，諭意指，遂發兵浮海救東甌。未至，閩越引兵而去。東甌請舉國徙中國，乃悉舉眾來，處江淮之閒。","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue","source_id":"s-shiji114-dongyue","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:p003","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/114.json"}],"references":[{"title":"《史記曆書》索隱·太初改歲首","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記三家註/卷026&oldid=2514838","quote":"然漢始以建亥爲年首，今改以建寅，故以七年爲元年。","scope":"received_calendar_rule","text_layer":"suoyin_commentary","revision_id":2514838,"image_verified":false},{"title":"《史記·漢興以來將相名臣年表》","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷022&oldid=2607038","table_id":"shiji-022","table_cell_id":"shiji-022-t1-r067-c01","scope":"received_regnal_year_attestation","image_verified":false,"quote_passage_ref":"data/historical-tables/shiji-022.json"},{"title":"《史記·漢興以來將相名臣年表》","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷022&oldid=2607038","table_id":"shiji-022","table_cell_id":"shiji-022-t1-r069-c01","scope":"received_regnal_year_attestation","image_verified":false,"quote_passage_ref":"data/historical-tables/shiji-022.json"},{"title":"《史記·漢興以來將相名臣年表》","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷022&oldid=2607038","table_id":"shiji-022","table_cell_id":"shiji-022-t1-r069-c00","scope":"digital_editorial_regnal_year_equivalence_only","image_verified":false,"quote_passage_ref":"data/historical-tables/shiji-022.json"}],"regnal_year_table":{"kind":"table_year_row","table_id":"shiji-022","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-022","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-022","source_id":"table-witness-shiji-022","source_revision":"2607038","era_name":"建元","year_source_term":"三年","era_anchor_cell_id":"shiji-022-t1-r067-c01","regnal_year_cell_id":"shiji-022-t1-r069-c01","digital_year_cell_id":"shiji-022-t1-r069-c00","calendar_rule":"han_tenth_month_before_taichu"},"rationale":"原紀年建元三年保留；固定原年欄與數位年格分列。太初前十月歲首，原事未明月份或只明冬季，保留相鄰西元年範圍，不任填單年，不補公曆月日。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}}],"effective_period":{"st